---
import Button from "./Button.astro";
---

<section class="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about__inner container">
    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__head">
        <p class="section-label about__eyebrow">About the Author</p>
        <h2 id="about-title" class="about__title">
          Hi,<br /><span class="about__title-accent">I&rsquo;m Jenessa.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about__photo img-zoom">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/about-family.jpg"
          alt="Jenessa Wait with her husband Ben and their three children"
          width="400"
          height="405"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="about__body">
        <p class="about__text">
          <strong>Jenessa Wait</strong> is a wife, mother, creator, and speaker passionate
          about helping women step boldly into the promises of God. She runs a successful
          online business selling faith-filled goods around the world. Through her books and
          products, she reaches countless women with messages of truth, hope, and faith.
          Jenessa and her husband Ben serve on the leadership team at Bethel Austin. Jenessa
          and Ben have three children and live in Austin, Texas.
        </p>
        <p class="about__pull">
          After walking through seasons of waiting, unanswered prayers, and unexpected
          detours, she discovered that God&rsquo;s plan isn&rsquo;t simply to wait on
          Him&mdash;but to learn how to move with Him.
        </p>
        <p class="about__text">
          That journey became the foundation for her first book, Moving with God, a practical
          and hope-filled guide for anyone longing to step into the promises God has for them.
        </p>
        <Button href="#how-it-works" label="Pre-Order the Book" variant="primary" class="about__cta" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--color-cream-soft);
  }
  .about__inner {
    padding-block: 5em;
  }
  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 26em 1fr;
    grid-template-areas:
      "head body"
      "photo body";
    column-gap: 4em;
    row-gap: 1.5em;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about__head { grid-area: head; }
  .about__photo { grid-area: photo; align-self: start; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
  .about__body { grid-area: body; }

  .about__eyebrow { color: var(--color-dark); }
  .about__title {
    margin-top: 0.5em;
    color: var(--color-dark);
    font-size: 4.5em;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  .about__title-accent { color: var(--color-blue); }
  .about__photo {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .about__photo img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .about__text {
    font-size: 1.25em;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .about__text strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .about__pull {
    margin-block: 2.25em;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-dark);
    font-size: 1.875em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
  }
  /* button class is passed to the Button component (different scope) — needs :global */
  .about__body :global(.about__cta) { margin-top: 4em; }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 20em 1fr;
      column-gap: 2.5em;
    }
    .about__title { font-size: 3.5em; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-areas:
        "head"
        "body"
        "photo";
      row-gap: 2em;
    }
    .about__photo { max-width: 26em; align-self: start; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
  }
</style>
